<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div>You've recently expressed interest in enrolling in one of ASU's <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/">College of Health Solutions’</a> graduate programs. The college anticipates and responds to demands for highly qualified health professionals as the health industry transforms. Classes are offered online, full-time and part-time, and in the evenings &nbsp;to meet the needs of working professionals, students moving directly into a graduate program, or people who are making career changes.</div><div><br></div><div>Are you considering starting a graduate program in the fall? If so, let’s work together to create a timeline to get your <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">application</a> submitted before the program begins. If the deadline has passed, I’d like us to connect and talk about the next start date.</div><div><br></div><div>Please don’t hesitate to contact me with any other questions or if you’d like some application tips.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>{!User.Email}</div><div><br></div><div><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div><br></div></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>